r_2":"Yes! All of your purchases are available in the game on all platforms.","faq_3":"How can I donate a pass to my friend?","faq_answer_3":"You can donate a pass to your Supercell ID friends via the in-game Supercell ID menu. Detailed instructions can be found \u003cSameTab\u003ehere#help#guide\u003c/SameTab\u003e.","faq_4":"After I buy, where are my purchases saved?","faq_answer_4":"Some items such as the passes are stored in your Supercell ID. You can see it in the in-game Settings. You can also see your items on the “Account” page of the Supercell Store. Note that some items, such as Gems and Diamonds are added instantly to your game account.","faq_5":"“Unable to purchase” What does that mean?","faq_answer_5":"Some of the items require that your game account is for example high enough level before you can buy them. Also, if your game account is for example banned, you won’t be able to buy anything for that account. If you keep getting this message, please contact \u003cNewTab\u003eSupport#https://help.supercellsupport.com\u003c/NewTab\u003e.","faq_6":"Will the pass I purchased activate immediately in the game?","faq_answer_6":"No, you can activate it when you want. Open Supercell ID in the game to access your inventory. ","faq_7":"I can’t complete my purchase. What should I do?","faq_answer_7":"Try a different payment method if you can. If the problem persists, contact your bank or the issuer of your payment method.","faq_9":"Creator Code is not accepted.","faq_answer_9":"Check with the Creator one more time and make sure that the code is typed in exactly as it has been given by them. It's not case sensitive, but all the characters need to be in the right order!","faq_10":"Where do I find my purchase history?","faq_answer_10":"You can find your purchase history on the \"Account\" page. First, log in using your Supercell ID account, then click on the avatar image on the top corner of the page.","faq_11":"What are the supported payment methods in the Store?","faq_answer_11":"Supported payment methods depend on your country. In addition to some local payment methods, credit cards and PayPal are generally supported in all countries.","faq_12":"I don't see my purchased product in the game.","faq_answer_12":"Make sure you are logged in to the game with the same Supercell ID account that you used to make the purchase. If the purchase is still not visible, contact support: \u003cNewTab\u003ehttps://help.supercellsupport.com/en/#https://help.supercellsupport.com/en/\u003c/NewTab\u003e\n\n","faq_14":"I've seen another site that offers me products for Supercell games. Can I buy them?","faq_answer_14":"Supercell Store is the official online marketplace to buy in-game products for our games. Supported 3rd party stores: \u003cNewTab\u003eRazer Gold#https://gold.razer.com\u003c/NewTab\u003e, \u003cNewTab\u003eCodashop#https://www.codashop.com\u003c/NewTab\u003e, \u003cNewTab\u003eMidasbuy#https://www.midasbuy.com\u003c/NewTab\u003e, \u003cNewTab\u003eCarry1st#https://shop.carry1st.com\u003c/NewTab\u003e. Stay safe! Unauthorized gem dealers may steal credit cards, game accounts and personal information.","faq_15":"How can I redeem the purchased items in-game?","faq_answer_15":"Some items such as Passes are stored in your Supercell ID inventory. You can redeem the Pass via the Supercell ID game view, or the game’s Season view. All other items, such as Diamonds, Gems, resources, or items are added instantly to your game account.","faq_16":"My friend didn’t receive the pass I donated him.","faq_answer_16":"To troubleshoot the issue please refer to the Supercell Support website: \u003cNewTab\u003ehttps://help.supercellsupport.com/en/#https://help.supercellsupport.com/en/\u003c/NewTab\u003e.","faq_17":"I bought more items and received fewer items in-game.","faq_answer_17":"To troubleshoot the issue please refer to the Supercell Support website: \u003cNewTab\u003ehttps://help.supercellsupport.com/en/#https://help.supercellsupport.com/en/\u003c/NewTab\u003e.","faq_18":"Where can I check the items stored in my Supercell ID?","faq_answer_18":"Open Supercell ID via the game settings or menu. You can also see your items on the “Account” page of the Supercell Store. Note: some items are sent directly to your game account and are not stored in your Supercell ID.","faq_19":"I bought items for the wrong game account.","faq_answer_19":"Please contact support via the Supercell Support website: \u003cNewTab\u003ehttps://help.supercellsupport.com/en/#https://help.supercellsupport.com/en/\u003c/NewTab\u003e.","faq_22":"Where do I see my receipts for purchases on the Supercell Store?","faq_answer_22":"We will send a receipt of all your purchases to the email you used to sign up for Supercell ID. Your purchase history is also available on the \"Account\" page.","faq_23":"My child accidentally made an in-app purchase. Can I get a refund?","faq_answer_23":"To properly assist you, please send our dedicated Support team a message from within the game that the purchase was made. Contact us via the game's Settings \u003e Help and Support.","go_to_faq":"Go to FAQ","our_games":"Our games","information":"Information","wf_landing_hero_tit":"The World Finals 2023 are on!","wf_landing_hero_text":"Check out the special limited-time offers for \u003cBold\u003eClash of Clans\u003c/Bold\u003e and \u003cBold\u003eClash Royale\u003c/Bold\u003e!","wf_landing_hero_btn1":"See our current offers","wf_landing_hero_btn2":"Watch live","wf_landing_hero_btn2b":"Event website","wf_landing_featured_title":"Latest special offers","wf_landing_moreoffers_title":"More offers","wf_product_category":"Offer","wf_login_products_title":"Log in to see our offers","wf_login_single_product_title":"Log in to see the offer","gen_login_toaccess_title":"Log in to access this page","wf_offer_404_modal_title":"Offer not found","wf_offer_404_modal_body":"Unfortunately the offer you were looking for doesn't exist or it may have expired.","wf_offers_not_found":"No offe